            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>Overcoming Obstacles....</head>
               <p rend="justify">Carver in Lab</p>
               <p rend="justify">George Washington Carver overcame many obstacles that could have stopped him from becoming a successful, happy man. Read the vocabulary words below and explain how George overcome each of these obstacles.</p>
               <p rend="justify">
                  <hi rend="bold">Racism</hi>
               </p>
               <p rend="justify">the belief that people of one race are superior to people of other races</p>
               <p rend="justify">
                  <hi rend="bold">Segregation</hi>
               </p>
               <p rend="justify">separation of people based upon differences</p>
               <p rend="justify">
                  <hi rend="bold">Prejudice</hi>
               </p>
               <p rend="justify">predetermined judgement about someone</p>
               <p rend="justify">
                  <hi rend="bold">Illness</hi>
               </p>
               <p rend="justify">George had whooping cough and the croup as a child</p>
               <p rend="justify">
                  <hi rend="bold">Becoming Orphaned</hi>
               </p>
               <p rend="justify">George lost both his parents when he was little</p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>Art....</head>
               <p rend="justify">Carver in Lab</p>
               <p rend="justify">George loved to paint and discovered new ways to make colors from soil and different plants. Draw a picture of your favorite place at the park.</p>
               <p rend="justify">{Palette}</p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
