               <p rend="justify">Carver in Lab</p>
               <p rend="justify">George Washington Carver was a lifetime learner. Check the correct answers.</p>
               <p rend="justify">1. Young George was allowed to attend school at the Locust Grove School near the Carver farm.</p>
