               <head>Junior Ranger Code</head>
               <p rend="justify">As a Junior Ranger, I will do my best to:</p>
               <p rend="justify">1. Explore other National Parks.</p>
               <p rend="justify">2. Obey all safety rules.</p>
               <p rend="justify">3. Leave plants, animals, and historic objects in the park as I found them.</p>
               <p rend="justify">4. Learn more about African American history.</p>
               <p rend="justify">5. Help keep our National Parks clean, safe, and beautiful for everyone.</p>
